      "source_id": "src-756cdb331d0e",
      "text": "What Claimlane does\nClaimlane takes first-notice-of-loss emails and attachments from small insurance brokers, extracts the structured claim, checks it against the policy schedule and opens the claim in Applied Epic.\nThe workflow\nClaimlane works inside the first notice of loss intake that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
